    {
      "item": "Recognition of deferred tax asset",
      "1": "As per the group policy, which is in line with IAS 12 (Income Taxes), deferred tax assets are recognised only to the extent that it is probable that future taxable profits will be available against which temporary differences can be utilised. The directors have therefore reassessed whether it is appropriate to recognise deferred tax asset relating to tax losses in view of the continued loss position of the group. As a result, deferred tax asset of KSh 303 million has been derecognised in the financial statements.",
